{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_15_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_15","textTraditional":"一、四年，春，正月，公狩於郎。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_15_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_15","textTraditional":"四時之田，皆為宗廟之事也。春曰田，夏曰苗，秋曰蒐，冬曰狩。四時之田用三焉，唯其所先得。一為乾豆，二為賓客，三為充君之庖。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_15_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_15","textTraditional":"二、夏，天王使宰渠伯糾來聘。","sentenceOrder":3}],"overrides":{}}